INSERT INTO city_chunks VALUES(37,'atlanta',10,'sk - Content: Leaders warn that without sustained funding similar to prior stimulus, gains are at risk. Rising rents and low vacancy could outpace current capacity to prevent and resolve homelessness. ### State-level supportive housing (GHFA PSH) - FACT: Permanent Supportive Housing program - Topic: services_psh_state - Content: Georgia’s GHFA Permanent Supportive Housing program provides HUD‑funded rental assistance plus services for people with disabilities who are homeless, including serious mental illness, chronic substance use, and AIDS‑related conditions. - FACT: PSH goals - Topic: services_psh_goals - Content: GHFA PSH aims to increase housing stability, skills or income, and self‑sufficiency for people with disabilities. Local providers match rental assistance with tailored supportive services for this hard‑to‑reach population. ### Atlanta Mission and service myths - FACT: Demand for help (Atlanta Mission) - Topic: services_demand - Content: In 2023, over 3,600 people came to Atlanta Mission seeking shelter. Many reported histories of trauma, violence, addiction, health problems, and job loss contributing to their homelessness. - FACT: Desire for change and work - Topic: services_motivation - Content: Atlanta Mission reports hundreds of people completing needs assessments, progressing through programs, and ending their homelessness.','[0.039276123046875,-0.029998779296875,0.00919342041015625,0.01363372802734375,0.0780029296875,0.044647216796875,0.0689697265625,0.044708251953125,-0.03924560546875,-0.0498046875,-0.01284027099609375,-0.0002751350402832031,-0.0823974609375,0.027801513671875,-0.005702972412109375,0.030609130859375,0.0889892578125,-0.0009412765502929688,0.0037326812744140625,0.028289794921875,-0.0040435791015625,0.057464599609375,0.00919342041015625,0.034393310546875,0.021575927734375,-0.00433349609375,0.01207733154296875,-0.0221710205078125,-0.06671142578125,-0.01477813720703125,0.0223846435546875,-