INSERT INTO city_chunks VALUES(51,'dc',3,'ACT: System strain from new and returning households - Topic: contributing_factors_inflow - Content: High inflow of people new to the CoC or returning after prior exits to housing undermines progress. Even as many are housed each year, new and returning households keep overall numbers elevated. ### Common life experiences - FACT: Domestic and intimate partner violence - Topic: life_experiences_violence - Content: Surviving domestic or intimate partner violence is the most common life experience among adults in families. About a quarter of unaccompanied adults report it, rising to nearly half of unaccompanied women. - FACT: Other life experiences - Topic: life_experiences_other - Content: Among unaccompanied adults, notable shares report limited English, foster care history, and institutional stays. Institutional residence is especially common among them, much more than among adults in families. --- ## Subpopulations and conditions ### Veterans - FACT: Veterans - Topic: subpopulation_veterans - Content: The veteran count fell by 5 people in 2024 and by 96 (–45%) since 2020. In FY23, 335 veterans were housed, a 33% increase over FY22, and most veterans served were single adults rather than in families.','[0.01560211181640625,-0.01174163818359375,0.02435302734375,-0.0287017822265625,0.044647216796875,0.02691650390625,0.08172607421875,0.051849365234375,-0.029998779296875,-0.031524658203125,-0.0144805908203125,-0.025299072265625,-0.054779052734375,0.006343841552734375,-0.01483154296875,0.06634521484375,0.0435791015625,0.00989532470703125,0.05078125,-0.02294921875,0.020172119140625,0.01337432861328125,0.056365966796875,0.056884765625,0.03228759765625,-0.03448486328125,0.03533935546875,-0.060638427734375,-0.057373046875,0.0030345916748046875,-0.009307861328125,-0.0260009765625,-0.01328277587890625,-0.0213165283203125,0.01560211181640625,0.00913238525390625,-0.04193115234375,-0.0004916191101074219,0.012969970703125,-0.00640487670898