INSERT INTO city_chunks VALUES(63,'la',8,'opulation_veterans - Content: Veterans experiencing homelessness decreased from roughly 3,878 to 2,991 (≈23% drop). This indicates improved housing outcomes for veterans compared to some other groups. --- ## System response and priorities - FACT: Coordinated emergency response - City: Los Angeles - Topic: system_response - Content: Leaders attribute 2024’s declines in unsheltered and chronic homelessness to an unprecedented coordinated emergency response, including encampment resolutions and strengthened rehousing efforts. - FACT: Strategic priorities – LAHSA - City: Los Angeles - Topic: system_priorities - Content: LAHSA’s strategic areas focus on addressing the emergency, improving rehousing efficiency, clarifying purpose and accountability, reforming contracting and grants, and centering equity in all actions. - FACT: Rehousing system goals - City: Los Angeles - Topic: housing_system_goals - Content: New goals call for at least a 20% increase in street‑to‑interim placements and interim‑to‑permanent housing moves next year. Progress will be tracked through key performance indicators. - FACT: Encampment resolutions and dwelling changes - City: Los Angeles - Topic: encampment_response - Content: Encampment resolution work contributed to fewer makeshift shelters and vehicle‑based or tent dwellings.','[0.04766845703125,-0.002971649169921875,0.033447265625,-0.002410888671875,0.058135986328125,0.044097900390625,0.044891357421875,0.0291595458984375,-0.0643310546875,-0.06719970703125,-0.05950927734375,-0.0211639404296875,-0.057647705078125,0.0201416015625,0.0030040740966796875,0.05218505859375,0.07525634765625,-0.0088653564453125,-0.00853729248046875,0.0054931640625,0.03436279296875,0.0240631103515625,0.0052490234375,0.038330078125,0.054046630859375,-0.005474090576171875,0.029083251953125,-0.017730712890625,-0.07244873046875,-0.0211334228515625,0.0245208740234375,-0.040191650390625,-0.026824951171875,-0.050079345703125,0.029861450