INSERT INTO city_chunks VALUES(83,'portland',5,'intended to provide enough beds for a majority of unsheltered people in the region. The plan includes a limit on length of stay (around three months) and aims to move people quickly through shelters. - IMPACT: People who cannot secure housing within the time limit may cycle back into homelessness, especially when there is no matching increase in permanent housing options. ## CRITIQUE: Limits of short shelter stays - Type: barrier_to_housing - Content: Local providers and experts warn that strict stay limits do not account for the shortage of permanent housing. Even highly motivated guests who meet with case managers and seek work may struggle to find housing within the time allowed, leading to returns to homelessness. ## PROGRAM HUB: Portland Solutions - Type: program_hub - Content: Portland Solutions is a centralized city initiative launched to coordinate key homelessness‑related functions, including outreach, shelter operations, impact reduction in public spaces, and livability efforts. It combines several teams into a single structure to improve coordination and continuity. ### RESOURCE GROUP: City Shelter Services - Type: resource_team - Population: people moving from unsheltered life toward stability - Content: City Shelter Services manages alternative shelters, overnight shelters, and day centers.','[0.01016998291015625,-0.031829833984375,-0.033721923828125,0.01371002197265625,0.0899658203125,0.0281829833984375,0.0665283203125,0.0204315185546875,-0.038330078125,-0.0555419921875,-0.034942626953125,-0.044158935546875,-0.061553955078125,0.03167724609375,-0.00907135009765625,0.03448486328125,0.0687255859375,-0.03289794921875,-0.00965118408203125,0.01399993896484375,0.044677734375,0.0007004737854003906,0.0321044921875,0.0302886962890625,0.0278778076171875,-0.0009870529174804688,0.01180267333984375,-0.0150146484375,-0.0594482421875,0.0139007568359375,0.024383544921875,0.00799560546875,-0.037445068359375,-0.017868041992